the previous UK National Lottery licence, which was included in receivables, was released. This resulted in a €63 million reduction in the prize expense, increasing GGR, and an increase in Good Cause contributions of an equivalent amount; hence, there was no impact on Net Revenue or Adjusted EBITDA. There was also no impact on the prize payout to players. GGR comparisons with 2024 on an adjusted basis exclude this one-off effect._\n\n_(2) J&T ARCH INVESTMENTS SICAV, a.s. (“J&T ARCH”), a qualified investor fund listed on the Prague Stock Exchange._\n\n","download_label":"Download PDF","createdAt":"2025-09-05T05:43:40.328Z","updatedAt":"2025-09-05T06:40:48.139Z","publishedAt":"2025-09-05T06:40:48.222Z","locale":"en","download_file":{"id":3964,"documentId":"ndpb4s3qyiwspm6izsrqb8vo","name":"AIlwyn International_2Q25-Preliminary-results-release.pdf","alternativeText":null,"caption":null,"width":null,"height":null,"formats":null,"hash":"A_Ilwyn_International_2_Q25_Preliminary_results_release_bbd3f42d42","ext":".pdf","mime":"application/pdf","size":627.32,"url":"https://cdn.allwyn.com/A_Ilwyn_International_2_Q25_Preliminary_results_release_bbd3f42d42.pdf","previewUrl":null,"provider":"aws-s3","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2025-09-05T06:27:54.017Z","updatedAt":"2025-09-05T06:27:54.017Z","publishedAt":"2025-09-05T06:27:54.017Z","focalPoint":null},"metadata":{"id":3173,"title":null,"description":null,"og_title":null,"og_description":null,"noindex":null},"localizations":[],"dynamic_zone":[]},{"id":1357,"documentId":"yvor0keuw5zcsjbj7pbzy95h","heading":"Second Quarter 2025 Preliminary Results conference call invitation","slug":"second-quarter-2025-preliminary-results-conference-call-invitation","date":"2025-08-29","perex":"Allwyn International AG management kindly invites you to participate in the Second Quarter 2025\nPreliminary Results Conference Call & Webcast on Friday, 5th September 2025 at 15:00 CEST time (14:00\nUK / 09:00 ET). The Second Quarter 2025 Preliminar